<title>USA: Most issues in USAir suit still before court.</title>
<headline>Most issues in USAir suit still before court.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The bulk of USAir Group Inc's claims against AMR Corp and British Airways Plc remain undecided, as a federal judge Friday dismissed only one claim against AMR Corp.</p>
<p>U.S. District Court judge Miriam Cedarbaum will decide later whether to grant British Airways and American Airline's motion to dismiss USAir's other claims in the suit.</p>
<p>American and BA are seeking to form a massive alliance, which USAir contends would undermine an existing relationship between USAir and BA.</p>
</text>
